# Nothing generated lives here yet. Kept so the repo has an obvious place
# to declare exclusions when it grows.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# /context-graph and /blast-radius output. Derived, rebuilt on every run, and
# committing it turns every session into a diff.
#
# The **/ prefix matters: a pattern with an interior slash is anchored to this
# file's directory, so a bare `.claude/context-graph/` would not cover the
# copies the tools write under tests/fixtures/ when run against one.
**/.claude/context-graph/
